{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14037","headline":"题清源寺 · 耿湋","name":"题清源寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儒墨兼宗道，云泉隐旧庐。\n盂城今寂寞，辋水自纡余。\n内学销多累，西林易故居。\n深房春竹老，细雨夜钟疎。\n陈迹留金地，遗文在石渠。\n不知登座客，谁得蔡邕书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}